IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-PD-DISAGGREGATED.

DATA DIVISION.
01 PREFILL-INSTANCES   PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 DECODE-INSTANCES    PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 TOTAL-INSTANCES     PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 LATENCY-MS-X100     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PD-MESH.
    IF PREFILL-INSTANCES == 0
        MOVE 2 TO PREFILL-INSTANCES.
    END-IF.

    IF DECODE-INSTANCES == 0
        MOVE 6 TO DECODE-INSTANCES.
    END-IF.

    MOVE PREFILL-INSTANCES TO TOTAL-INSTANCES.
    ADD DECODE-INSTANCES TO TOTAL-INSTANCES.
    MOVE 145 TO LATENCY-MS-X100.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 TOTAL-INSTANCES.
    WEIGHT 30 LATENCY-MS-X100.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

END-STRATEGY.
